@startuml
title 3.16.13 Update a donation campaign
caption UC-160 | Planned | Proposed design
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 0
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam LegendBackgroundColor white
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
show footbox
<style>
lifeLine {
    LineStyle 0
}
</style>
skinparam sequence {
    ParticipantBackgroundColor white
    ActorBackgroundColor white
    LifeLineBackgroundColor white
    LifeLineBorderColor black
    GroupBackgroundColor white
    GroupHeaderBackgroundColor white
}

' Source: docs/requirements/uc.md
' Main entity migration: No migration: proposed entity only
' One-table abstraction: related repository reads/writes stay inside the service.
actor "Admin" as Actor
participant "Donation Campaign UI (proposed)" as Page
participant "Campaign API (proposed)" as API
participant "Campaign Service (proposed)" as Service
participant "donation_campaigns" as Table <<proposed entity>>

Actor -> Page: 1: Update a donation campaign
activate Page
Page -> Page: 2: Edit campaign details and supply a change reason
Page -> API: 3: Update donation campaign (proposed interface)
activate API
API -> API: 4: Authenticate active session and require ADMIN role
alt Session and required permission are valid
    API -> API: 5: Proposed: validate id, mutable fields and schedule
    alt Request input is valid
        API -> Service: 6: Update a donation campaign for the current actor
        activate Service
        Service -> Service: 7: Begin proposed transaction
        Service -> Table: 8: Lock campaign and read current state (proposed)
        activate Table
        Table --> Service: 9: Campaign or no record
        deactivate Table
        alt Campaign exists and may be updated
            Service -> Service: 10: Validate new schedule and rules; preserve past item outcomes
            Service -> Table: 11: Update allowed campaign fields (proposed)
            activate Table
            Table --> Service: 12: Proposed updated campaign
            deactivate Table
            Service -> Service: 13: Record before/after history and actor/reason; commit
            Service --> API: 14: Updated campaign (proposed)
            API --> Page: 15: HTTP 200 (proposed): Updated campaign (proposed)
            Page --> Actor: 16: Display saved campaign and retained history
        else Campaign missing, closed or update invalid
            Service --> API: 10.1: Campaign update is not allowed
            API --> Page: 10.2: HTTP 404, 409 or 422 (proposed)
            Page --> Actor: 10.3: Display error; do not report success
        end
        deactivate Service
    else Invalid request input
        API --> Page: 6.1: Proposed validation error response
        Page --> Actor: 6.2: Display validation errors; do not execute the operation
    end
else Missing/invalid session or required permission
    API --> Page: 5.1: Proposed authentication/access error response
    Page --> Actor: 5.2: Show session or access error; no protected result
end
deactivate API
deactivate Page

legend bottom left
PLANNED: API/UI and donation_campaigns table are proposed, not present in the runtime or migrations.
Required schema and policy design remain open.
endlegend

@enduml
